  portrait: {fileID: -241550066969217806, guid: 1acfa02fd4e21b34ab815885ff95ebf9, type: 3}
  speakerName: Shana
  DialogText:
  - 'To open the menu press esc. '
  - 'Then use the mouse to click party. '
  - To equip your equipment click on one of the 3 slots below your stats.
  - Click on the labeled buttons at the top to switch party members you are looking
    at.
  - Press esc to go back. Click inventory to see all the items you have.
  - 'If you want to use an item outside of battle just click it then select who you
    want to use it on.  '
